=== entitlements as a super admin
GET /api/admin/entitlements as super admin
status: 200
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "caps": {},
  "features": [
    "gadgets",
    "widgets"
  ],
  "license_module": false,
  "plan": "free",
  "state": "free",
  "tenant_quota": 0,
  "withheld": []
}

=== entitlements as an admin
GET /api/admin/entitlements as admin
status: 200
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "caps": {},
  "features": [
    "gadgets",
    "widgets"
  ],
  "license_module": false,
  "plan": "free",
  "state": "free",
  "tenant_quota": 0,
  "withheld": []
}

=== entitlements with no credential
GET /api/admin/entitlements
status: 401
Cache-Control: no-store
Content-Type: application/json
body (json, newline):
{
  "code": "unauthorized",
  "error": "authentication required",
  "request_id": "<request-id>"
}

